## 💡 Key Insights and Findings

The project explores the relationship between delivery-related factors and delivery duration.

### Key Findings

- Analyzed the relationship between delivery distance and delivery time.
- Investigated how traffic and weather conditions influence delivery duration.
- Explored the impact of preparation time on overall delivery time.
- Examined the relationship between courier experience and delivery performance.
- Developed a Linear Regression model to estimate delivery time.

### Business Recommendations

- Use predicted delivery times to improve delivery planning.
- Monitor deliveries with unusually high predicted durations.
- Analyze traffic and weather conditions to identify potential operational bottlenecks.
- Improve resource allocation based on delivery distance and preparation time.
- Use historical delivery data to support operational decisions.


